      "title": "曜日 — days of the week",
      "pattern": "〜曜日 / 何曜日ですか",
      "meaning": "(day) of the week / What day is it?",
      "explanation": "Each day of the week is a nature word plus 曜日 (ようび): 月 moon = Monday, 火 fire = Tuesday, 水 water = Wednesday, 木 wood = Thursday, 金 gold = Friday, 土 earth = Saturday, and 日 sun = Sunday. To ask what day something is, use 何曜日ですか. Join a day and a time of day with の: 金曜日の夜 is Friday night.",
